𒑰 DUB.SAR 1.0 Example: Mathematical Determinations
𒑰 Difficulty: Intermediate
𒑰 Concept: Determinations & Compound Records
𒑰 Mode: Mixed (Cuneiform syntax with Latin identifiers)
𒑰
𒑰 Purpose:
𒑰   Demonstrates structured mathematical determination records, grouping
𒑰   multiple measurement quantities into a single compound record and accessing
𒑰   its fields.
𒑰
𒑰 Expected Output:
𒑰   Parcel area:
𒑰   360 length^2
𒑰   Parcel width:
𒑰   15 kus
𒑰   Parcel depth:
𒑰   24 kus

𒂊𒁹
    width : 15 cubit
    depth : 24 cubit
    parcel : width, depth
    area :
        parcel.width
        parcel.depth
        𒊭

𒅗𒁹
    𒁹𒀀 "Parcel area:"
    𒁹𒀀 area
    𒁹𒀀 "Parcel width:"
    𒁹𒀀 parcel.width
    𒁹𒀀 "Parcel depth:"
    𒁹𒀀 parcel.depth
